  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・データを{捏造|ねつぞう}する - to fabricate data\n・{証拠|しょうこ}を{捏造|ねつぞう}する - to forge evidence\n・{歴史|れきし}の{捏造|ねつぞう} - falsification of history\n・{論文|ろんぶん}{捏造|ねつぞう} - research fraud/fabrication\n\nUSAGE CONTEXT:\nCommon in news reporting about scandals, academic misconduct, or legal cases.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n・{改竄|かいざん} - falsification, tampering (altering existing documents)\n・{歪曲|わいきょく} - distortion, misrepresentation\n・{偽造|ぎぞう} - forgery, counterfeiting (especially documents, money)",
